                                   "title":  "Your Name.",
                                   "snippet":  "[MAL Review of Your Name. by Jex, score 3/10]: Makoto Shinkai\u0027s latest work goes even further to support the theory that he\u0027s fantastic at directing a visually brilliant movie, but lacks the writing ability to tell a good story. Plot: An absolute mess. Without spoiling it, this movie fails to get into the main plot until roughly halfway through. Before that point, it views like a teenage slice of life; nothing to be disappointed by. After the halfway mark, the plot becomes incredibly contrived with no logic, reason, or thought put into its c",
